   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Multifunctional Water Supply systems for Machubo Administrative Post - Marracuene District</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Resilient Multifunctional Water Supply Systems for the Machubo Administrative Post project aims to improve water access, sanitation, and climate resilience in Marracuene District, Mozambique. Implemented by UNDP in collaboration with the Ministry of Public Works, Housing, and Water Resources, this one-year initiative (2024-2025) is funded by the IBSA Fund. The project will increase water security, improve livelihoods, and promote climate resilience in Machubo, ensuring better health, educati</narrative>
  </description>
